## Supabase
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key-here

## Supabase (alias for server-side)
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

## Google AI (Gemini) — APENAS server-side, nunca expor no frontend
## NÃO use prefixo VITE_ pois exporia a chave no bundle JS
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key-here

## Meta/Facebook OAuth (opcional)
META_APP_ID=your-meta-app-id
META_APP_SECRET=your-meta-app-secret

## TikTok Integration
TIKTOK_CLIENT_KEY=your-tiktok-client-key
TIKTOK_CLIENT_SECRET=your-tiktok-client-secret

## Admin
SUPREME_ADMIN_EMAIL=eldastito@gmail.com

## Application
APP_URL=http://localhost:3000
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://localhost:5173
NODE_ENV=development
